        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "binary encryption provides a confidentiality protected way for private key provisioning to the EVCC without having intermediaries access to this private key. Both approaches require asymmetric key material. The credentials for EVCC signing are provided by the private key associated with the contract certificate and credentials for EVCC receiving encrypted data are provided by an ECDH key exchange as described in 7.9.2.5.4.",
